  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Experience explosive energy and unparalleled comfort with every stride in the ASICS Novablast 5. Featuring a tongue wing construction, these shoes with added stretch, reduced tongue movement, and an improved fit help you train like a beast. The Flyte Foam Blast Max cushioning softens every step during long-distance runs, while the Trampoline-inspired outsole ensures responsive bounce back for a comfortable time on the tracks. Constructed with an upper featuring at least 75% recycled content, these shoes keep you fresh while contributing to a greener planet for longer. From conquering miles to training light, you can rely on the ASICS Novablast 5 for an exciting ride.</p> <p><strong>ASICS Novablast 5 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Engineered mesh upper ensures maximum airflow.</li> <li>Reflective details enable visibility in low-light settings.</li> <li>AHAR LO rubber outsole offers traction, improved softness, and advanced durability.</li> <li>Weight: 8.6 oz.</li> </ul> <p>*Sockliner is crafted using a solution dyeing process that cuts water usage by 33% and carbon emissions by 45% compared to traditional methods.</p><hr /><p>Daily training, long runs, and all-day wear feel easier in the ASICS Novablast 5. Designed to keep each stride soft, springy, and smooth, this versatile road runner balances max-cushioned comfort with a lively rebound, while the breathable upper and secure tongue design help you stay locked in from warm-up miles to recovery walks.</p><ul><li>FF BLAST MAX cushioning helps soften landings and add energetic bounce.</li><li>Engineered mesh upper promotes airflow for a light, breathable feel.</li><li>Tongue wing construction adds stretch, helps reduce tongue movement, and improves fit.</li><li>Trampoline-inspired outsole supports responsive toe-offs.</li><li>AHAR LO rubber outsole is built for traction, softness, and durable road use.</li><li>Reflective details and an upper made with at least 75% recycled content add functional finishing touches.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, we recommend ordering your usual size. Reviewers most often describe the Novablast 5 as true to size with a comfortable, accommodating toe box, while runners between sizes or looking for a little extra room up front may prefer going up a half size.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for daily training, long runs, recovery miles, treadmill sessions, and comfortable all-day wear.</p>  <p><strong>Cushioning &amp; Road Feel</strong></p><p>Runners consistently call out the plush, bouncy ride and strong energy return, with enough softness to stay comfortable over distance without feeling overly bulky. On the road or treadmill, it delivers a smooth, stable feel that works well for easy miles, steady efforts, and longer sessions.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say the comfort shows up right away with little break-in, and many note the cushioning and outsole continue to perform well after plenty of miles. For runners logging heavy weekly mileage, rotating pairs and checking the upper and outsole over time can help keep the ride feeling fresh.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® Novablast 5 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Silver/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1011C193-001</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 43.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:cen